---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const updated = "October 20, 2026";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Tekmera" description="How Tekmera collects and uses information submitted through this website.">
  <article style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 24px 120px; color: #D8D1C3; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7">
    <h1 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 40px; margin: 0 0 8px">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: #94A3B8; margin: 0 0 40px">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 22px">Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you use our contact form, we collect the details you choose to provide: your name, work email, organization, industry and message. We do not ask for health or patient information through this website, and you should not submit it.</p>

    <h2 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 22px">How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use this information only to respond to your inquiry and, if you opt in, to send occasional updates about Tekmera. We do not sell or rent your information.</p>

    <h2 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 22px">Service providers</h2>
    <p>Our website is hosted by Netlify, which also processes contact form submissions on our behalf. Hosting providers may collect standard technical data such as IP addresses and browser type to operate and secure the site.</p>

    <h2 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 22px">Retention</h2>
    <p>We keep inquiry information only as long as needed to respond and maintain a business relationship, or as required by law.</p>

    <h2 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 22px">Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the information you submitted, or unsubscribe from updates at any time, by contacting us through the <a href="/#contact">contact form</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 22px">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above shows when it was last revised.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
